      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ivor-sensei isn’t here at the dojo, if you’re looking\nfor him. But since you are here and all...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! I request a battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002100200049002000720065007100750065007300740020006100200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sensei may not be around to teach me, but I can\nuse you to get a new perspective on my skills!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me know as soon as you’re ready for our bout!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F007700200061007300200073006F006F006E00200061007300200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200066006F00720020006F0075007200200062006F00750074002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re ready to face me? Or did you want me to\nhelp you with your Plus Moves?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready to battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900200074006F00200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus Moves, yeah...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C007500730020004D006F007600650073002C00200079006500610068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Actually, I’m gonna go",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410063007400750061006C006C0079002C002000492019006D00200067006F006E006E006100200067006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s fair. I’m sure you have other things to be\ndealing with...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100742019007300200066006100690072002E002000492019006D0020007300750072006500200079006F0075002000680061007600650020006F00740068006500720020007400680069006E0067007300200074006F002000620065000A006400650061006C0069006E006700200077006900740068002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please show me what it takes to reach Rank A in\nthe Z-A Royale!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000730068006F00770020006D006500200077006800610074002000690074002000740061006B0065007300200074006F002000720065006100630068002000520061006E006B0020004100200069006E000A0074006800650020005A002D004100200052006F00790061006C0065002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re ready to face me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F002000660061006300650020006D0065003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>... You truly are worthy\nof<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbeing<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncalled<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLumiose’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nstrongest<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTrainer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whereas I...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680065007200650061007300200049002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t think I’ve grown any stronger at all.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200064006F006E201900740020007400680069006E006B00200049201900760065002000670072006F0077006E00200061006E00790020007300740072006F006E00670065007200200061007400200061006C006C002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m a total disgrace to the Fist of Justice...and by\nextension, to Ivor-sensei himself!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe I don’t even belong in the Fist of Justice...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610079006200650020004900200064006F006E201900740020006500760065006E002000620065006C006F006E006700200069006E0020007400680065002000460069007300740020006F00660020004A007500730074006900630065002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GRUOOOHHH!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700520055004F004F004F0048004800480021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GRUHAAAH!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700520055004800410041004100480021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Pangoro Duo! Not again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000500061006E0067006F0072006F002000440075006F00210020004E006F007400200061006700610069006E002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "These two are always causing us trouble—it’s like\nthey go out of their way to avoid the wild zones!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re real tough customers. Even Ivor-sensei\nhas a hard time driving them away unscathed.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But if Sensei isn’t here to protect the dojo, then\nthat duty falls to me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! Please fight at my\nside!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000010000201000000002100200050006C00650061007300650020006600690067006800740020006100740020006D0079000A0073006900640065002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nicely done, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006900630065006C007900200064006F006E0065002C00200010000201000000002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Growr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470072006F00770072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Go on, you two. The exit’s that way.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F0020006F006E002C00200079006F0075002000740077006F002E00200054006800650020006500780069007420190073002000740068006100740020007700610079002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ivor-sensei!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490076006F0072002D00730065006E007300650069002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, Josée...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWere you two responsible for those Pangoro\nleaving the dojo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Yes, Sensei! Thanks to\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwere<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nable<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nturn<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naway<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthose<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntroublemakers!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 24,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s no wonder <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀshe was able to save Lumiose.\nI got a glimpse of h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂiser true potential today.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whereas I...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680065007200650061007300200049002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Josée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006F007300E90065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, Sensei?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C002000530065006E007300650069003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you didn’t have just as much potential yourself,\nyou would not have been able to hold your own<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nalongside <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. In fact...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The only reason I left the dojo unattended was\nbecause I knew you could guard it in my stead.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You recognize the gap between your own skills\nand those of a master, and that very recognition<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nis proof of your self-awareness—nothing more.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know that you will continue to grow, Josée.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’ll be calling on your aid the next time that I must\nturn those Pangoro back myself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, Sensei! Thank you, Sensei!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C002000530065006E00730065006900210020005400680061006E006B00200079006F0075002C002000530065006E007300650069002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! Thank you for\neverything<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntoday!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000001000020100000000210020005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F0072000A00650076006500720079007400680069006E006700100001BE00000A0074006F006400610079002100100002011400330000",
